#: ../../tutorials/validate-load.md:1
msgid "教程：校验、导出并加载到训练循环"
msgstr "Tutorial: Validate, export, and load into a training loop"

#: ../../tutorials/validate-load.md:3
msgid "校验是阻断性的科学契约，不是“尽力而为”的预览。它检查 schema、源文件、维度、点与通道顺序、单位、坐标框架、硬件可行性、场景对齐和内容身份。"
msgstr "Validation is a blocking scientific contract, not a best-effort preview. It checks schemas, source files, dimensions, point and channel order, units, coordinate frames, hardware feasibility, scenario alignment, and content identities."

#: ../../tutorials/validate-load.md:5
msgid "校验与检查命令"
msgstr "Validation and inspection commands"

#: ../../tutorials/validate-load.md:12
msgid "两条命令都在 stdout 输出恰好一个 JSON envelope（成功 `ok: true`，失败 `ok: false`），进度与诊断走 stderr。`--pretty` 只是美化缩进；其他参数以各自的 `--help` 为准。"
msgstr "Both commands write exactly one JSON envelope on stdout (success `ok: true`, failure `ok: false`), with progress and diagnostics on stderr. `--pretty` only indents the output; other parameters follow each command's `--help`."

#: ../../tutorials/validate-load.md:14
msgid "Python 侧等价的校验器："
msgstr "The equivalent validator in Python:"

#: ../../tutorials/validate-load.md:23
msgid "加载环境"
msgstr "Load the environment"

#: ../../tutorials/validate-load.md:40
msgid "`info` 携带硬件约束证据；`terminated`/`truncated` 的语义见[概念：Gymnasium 接口](../concepts/gymnasium-interface)。"
msgstr "`info` carries hardware constraint evidence; `terminated`/`truncated` semantics: [Concept: Gymnasium interface](../concepts/gymnasium-interface)."

#: ../../tutorials/validate-load.md:42
msgid "交给训练代码前的最小清单"
msgstr "Minimal checklist before handing to training code"

#: ../../tutorials/validate-load.md:44
msgid "`validate_environment` 通过，所有 manifest 校验和与文件字节一致。"
msgstr "`validate_environment` passes and every manifest checksum matches the file bytes."

#: ../../tutorials/validate-load.md:45
msgid "`make_env` 能加载，`reset` 返回合法的观测与 `info`。"
msgstr "`make_env` loads, and `reset` returns a valid observation and `info`."

#: ../../tutorials/validate-load.md:46
msgid "至少执行一个合法 step，确认约束行为（`project_and_report` 或 `terminate`）符合预期。"
msgstr "Take at least one legal step and confirm the constraint behavior (`project_and_report` or `terminate`) matches expectations."

#: ../../tutorials/validate-load.md:47
msgid "确认观测形状、动作形状和奖励量纲与你的算法假设一致。"
msgstr "Confirm observation shape, action shape, and reward dimensions match your algorithm's assumptions."

#: ../../tutorials/validate-load.md:49
msgid "之后这个目录就可以像任何 Gymnasium 环境一样交给下游强化学习代码。"
msgstr "Afterwards the directory behaves like any Gymnasium environment for downstream reinforcement-learning code."
